<p>Rowlett sits along the shores of Lake Ray Hubbard on the east side of the Metroplex, and the city lies in both Dallas and Rockwall counties. Its housing is largely suburban subdivisions and lakeside homes, with established neighborhoods near downtown Rowlett and newer construction in other areas. Rowlett has also been struck by two significant tornadoes in recent years. If you need a public adjuster in Rowlett, TX, we can help you document damage, read your policy, and work through the claim.</p>
